{
    "title": "Roku Remote TV: Control & Cast",
    "description": "Looking for a convenient and easy-to-use remote control app for your Roku devices? Look no further than Roku Remote TV \u2013 the ultimate solution for controlling your Roku TV, Roku streaming player, and Roku Soundbar!\r\n\r\nWith Roku Remote TV, you can easily control your Roku devices from your smartphone or tablet. No more searching for multiple remote controls or struggling to remember which button does what. Our app provides a simple and intuitive interface that anyone can use.\r\n\r\nHere are just a few of the features that make Roku Remote TV the best choice for controlling your Roku devices:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easy Setup: Our app is easy to set up and automatically detects your Roku device. Simply connect your device to the same Wi-Fi network as your phone or tablet, and our app will do the rest.\r\n\r\n\u2022 ON/OFF CONTROLS. Turn your TV on or off right from your app. That's right!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 ADJUST VOLUME. Roku Remote - Control Your Smart TV is a complete (and better) replacement for your physical remote, so it can do everything it can, including changing channels and controlling the TV's volume.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Voice Search: With our app, you can search for movies, TV shows, and more using your voice. Just speak into your phone, and Roku Remote TV will do the rest.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Cast to TV: You can also cast your photos and videos to your TV using our app. Simply select the media you want to cast, and Roku Remote TV will do the rest.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Customizable Layout: You can customize the layout of your remote control to suit your preferences. Rearrange buttons, add or remove buttons, and change the background color to make your remote control uniquely yours.\r\n\r\n\u2022 No Ads (Premium upgrade): Our app is completely ad-free, so you can enjoy uninterrupted control over your Roku devices.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wear OS. Control your TV from your wrist thanks to the Wear OS app.\r\n\r\n With Roku TV Remote, you can control all the TCL TV brands including 4,5 and 6 Series.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to simplify your Roku remote control or want a convenient way to search and cast media to your TV, Roku Remote TV is the perfect solution. Download now and start controlling your Roku devices with ease!\r\n\r\n\r\nQuanticapps is not affiliated with Roku. This is a 3rd party app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a convenient and easy-to-use remote control app for your Roku devices? Look no further than Roku Remote TV \u2013 the ultimate solution for controlling your Roku TV, Roku streaming player, and Roku Soundbar!<br><br>With Roku Remote TV, you can easily control your Roku devices from your smartphone or tablet. No more searching for multiple remote controls or struggling to remember which button does what. Our app provides a simple and intuitive interface that anyone can use.<br><br>Here are just a few of the features that make Roku Remote TV the best choice for controlling your Roku devices:<br><br>\u2022 Easy Setup: Our app is easy to set up and automatically detects your Roku device. Simply connect your device to the same Wi-Fi network as your phone or tablet, and our app will do the rest.<br><br>\u2022 ON/OFF CONTROLS. Turn your TV on or off right from your app. That&#39;s right!<br><br><br>\u2022 ADJUST VOLUME. Roku Remote - Control Your Smart TV is a complete (and better) replacement for your physical remote, so it can do everything it can, including changing channels and controlling the TV&#39;s volume.<br><br>\u2022 Voice Search: With our app, you can search for movies, TV shows, and more using your voice. Just speak into your phone, and Roku Remote TV will do the rest.<br><br>\u2022 Cast to TV: You can also cast your photos and videos to your TV using our app. Simply select the media you want to cast, and Roku Remote TV will do the rest.<br><br>\u2022 Customizable Layout: You can customize the layout of your remote control to suit your preferences. Rearrange buttons, add or remove buttons, and change the background color to make your remote control uniquely yours.<br><br>\u2022 No Ads (Premium upgrade): Our app is completely ad-free, so you can enjoy uninterrupted control over your Roku devices.<br><br>\u2022 Wear OS. Control your TV from your wrist thanks to the Wear OS app.<br><br> With Roku TV Remote, you can control all the TCL TV brands including 4,5 and 6 Series.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re looking to simplify your Roku remote control or want a convenient way to search and cast media to your TV, Roku Remote TV is the perfect solution. Download now and start controlling your Roku devices with ease!<br><br><br>Quanticapps is not affiliated with Roku. This is a 3rd party app.",
